---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import GardenCTA from '../../components/GardenCTA.astro';
import StackCards from '../../components/StackCards.astro';
import HoneyWaves from '../../components/HoneyWaves.astro';
---
<Base hideGarden={true} title="1:1 Mentoring | The Soul Mami" description="One-on-one mentoring with Eliana, the Soul Mami. Untangle the loops, alchemize the emotions, and rebuild your self-trust, with a guide who walks beside you.">

  <!-- Beat: Invitation -->
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="wrap grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">1:1 · You and Me</span>
        <h1>Mentoring for the <em class="soul">real you</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          What if I told you that you already are everything you came
          to be. It's not about becoming you. It's about taking off the
          layers that were never yours to wear. Let's unlearn together.
          I will show you how to rebuild self-trust and self-belonging.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <!-- TODO: replace with Eliana's booking link (Calendly or similar) -->
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/lets-talk/">Start the conversation</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#what">What we work on</a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Just a conversation to see if we fit.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="photo photo--arch" src="/images/eliana-river-1200.webp" srcset="/images/eliana-river-600.webp 600w, /images/eliana-river-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 861px) 504px, 100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="Eliana standing peacefully in a river, eyes closed, hand to her heart" fetchpriority="high" style="max-height:460px;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- From here down, each section stacks over the last like a card. -->
  <div class="stack">

  <!-- Beat: Timing -->
  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Timing</span>
      <h2>When people usually come to me</h2>
      <ol class="timing-list">
        <li><strong>01 · The quiet crisis.</strong> Everything looks fine on paper and feels hollow in your chest.</li>
        <li><strong>02 · The threshold.</strong> A breakup, a career shift, a loss: an ending that's secretly an invitation.</li>
        <li><strong>03 · The overflow.</strong> Emotions running the show, and you're tired of outrunning them.</li>
        <li><strong>04 · The whisper.</strong> Something in you wants to be expressed (a project, a change, a truth), and it's getting louder.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>If one of those made your stomach flip a little: that's the one. Reach out.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/lets-talk/">Start the conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Paths -->
  <section class="section" id="paths">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose center" style="margin-inline:auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Your Path</span>
        <h2>Two ways to work with me</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2 paths" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Human Design Session</h3>
          <p class="muted">1:1 session · $350</p>
          <p>Learn your default setting. Book a 1:1 Human Design session and get your identity blueprint.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://calendly.com/thesoulmami/90" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a session</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Awaken Your Soul</h3>
          <p class="muted">Self-paced course</p>
          <p>My self-paced course. Do the work on your own time.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://soullifeacademy.thinkific.com/courses/awakenyoursoul" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start the course</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Reality -->
  <section class="section section--sand" id="what">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Work</span>
      <h2>What we actually work on</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        You bring what's alive for you. I bring a life fully lived, my
        ancestral wisdom and gifts, and a very high tolerance for the
        emotional deep end.
      </p>
      <ul class="work-list">
        <li><strong>The loops.</strong> The repeating patterns of doubt, shrinking, and self-abandonment. We find where they started and what they're protecting.</li>
        <li><strong>The layers.</strong> The identities you've been performing that were never yours. We take them off one at a time, with respect for why you put them on.</li>
        <li><strong>The emotions.</strong> I'm an emotional alchemist. Bring me any feeling and we'll transmute it and get the lesson. Nothing you carry is too much.</li>
        <li><strong>The expression.</strong> There's stuff only you came here to say and make. We get it out of your head and into the world.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Proof -->
  <section class="section witnessed">
    <HoneyWaves />
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose center" style="margin-inline:auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Witnessed</span>
        <h2>Words from people I've walked with</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <figure class="card quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"Working with Eliana was an amazing honor and for three months it was the most amazing feeling knowing there is someone in your corner working with you for your highest benefit. Through exercises, questions and honest conversations, I discovered different abilities to help sift through my emotions, fears and inner turbulence. I feel more independent and yet more co-dependent on the universe at the same time."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>Jessica F. Gonzalez, Esq. · 1:1 mentoring</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="card quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"I said no two times today because I felt it in my gut, like you said I do, that it was a no for me. I went back and forth with my mind coming up with reasons why I could do something when I didn't want to at all. This insight you gave me is truly the gift that keeps on giving."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>1:1 client</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="card quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"Thank you SO much for being you. You helped me click back in and anchor. Deeply needed. I'm already feeling refreshed."</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>1:1 client</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <GardenCTA />

  </div>
  <StackCards />

</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
  /* Path cards: equal height, buttons lined up at the bottom. */
  .paths .card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .paths .card .btn { margin-top: auto; }
  .work-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .work-list li {
    padding: 0.85rem 0 0.85rem 1.9rem;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sand-deep);
  }
  .work-list li::before {
    content: "✦";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--honey);
  }
  .timing-list { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; padding: 0; }
  .timing-list li { padding-block: 0.7rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sand-deep); }
</style>
